          "en": "we have an idToken field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.55,
          "end": 122.563,
          "en": "So therefore I know that I get back my idToken here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.77,
