          "end": 183.9,
          "en": "by simply awaiting createUser or login,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.9,
          "end": 186.65,
          "en": "And then in the end here, we get our token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.65,
          "end": 190.543,
          "en": "And that token can then be passed to authenticate.",
